                      "card": {
                        "type": "markdown",
                        "content": "{#- Maxi 2026-11-03: STM buses near home that reach a metro station (GTFS Realtime entry \"STM\",\n    sensor.stm_<stop>_arrival_1..3, refreshed every minute while party mode is on). One entry per stop/direction:\n    stop, usual route, metro station it reaches, metro line colour, walk in minutes (street grid, 80 m/min), corner,\n    the stop's arrival sensors.\n    Buses that leave before you can walk there are skipped; the next two are shown. Each entry links to\n    tablets-subviews/subview-bus-<stop>: a map with the stop, home and the buses that have a GPS position. -#}\n{%- set dirs = [\n  ['52457', '10', 'Papineau', '00B300', 1, 'De Lorimier/Marie-Anne',\n   ['sensor.stm_52457_arrival_1', 'sensor.stm_52457_arrival_2', 'sensor.stm_52457_arrival_3']],\n  ['52381', '97', 'Mont-Royal', 'D95700', 3, 'Mont-Royal/De Lorimier',\n   ['sensor.stm_52381_arrival_1', 'sensor.stm_52381_arrival_2', 'sensor.stm_52381_arrival_3']],\n  ['52389', '45', 'Papineau', '00B300', 5, 'Papineau/Marie-Anne',\n   ['sensor.stm_52389_arrival_1', 'sensor.stm_52389_arrival_2', 'sensor.stm_52389_arrival_3']],\n  ['52388', '45', 'Fabre', '0095E6', 5, 'Papineau/Marie-Anne',\n   ['sensor.stm_52388_arrival_1', 'sensor.stm_52388_arrival_2', 'sensor.stm_52388_arrival_3']],\n  ['52564', '29', 'Préfontaine', '00B300', 5, 'Rachel/De Lorimier',\n   ['sensor.stm_52564_arrival_1', 'sensor.stm_52564_arrival_2', 'sensor.stm_52564_arrival_3']],\n  ['52383', '97', 'Pie-IX', '00B300', 3, 'Mont-Royal/De Lorimier',\n   ['sensor.stm_52383_arrival_1', 'sensor.stm_52383_arrival_2', 'sensor.stm_52383_arrival_3']],\n] -%}\n{%- set route_colors = {'10': '009EE0', '29': '009EE0', '45': '781B7D', '97': '781B7D'} -%}\n{%- set ns = namespace(cells=[], asof=none) -%}\n{%- for stop, route, metro, line, walk, corner, sensors in dirs -%}\n  {%- set d = namespace(list=[]) -%}\n  {%- for e in sensors -%}\n    {%- set m = states(e) | float(-1) -%}\n    {%- if m >= 0 and (ns.asof is none or states[e].last_updated > ns.asof) -%}\n      {%- set ns.asof = states[e].last_updated -%}\n    {%- endif -%}\n    {%- if m >= walk -%}\n      {%- set d.list = d.list + [[m | int, state_attr(e, 'route_id') | string, state_attr(e, 'route_color') or '009EE0']] -%}\n    {%- endif -%}\n  {%- endfor -%}\n  {%- set first = d.list[0] if d.list else [none, route, route_colors.get(route, '009EE0')] -%}\n  {%- set station = 'Frontenac' if stop == '52383' and first[1] == '368' else metro -%}\n  {%- set times = namespace(t='') -%}\n  {%- for x in d.list[:2] -%}\n    {%- set times.t = times.t ~ (' · ' if loop.index > 1 else '') ~ ('<small>' ~ x[1] ~ '</small> ' if x[1] != first[1] else '')\n      ~ ('<b>' ~ x[0] ~ '</b>' if loop.first else x[0] | string) -%}\n  {%- endfor -%}\n  {%- set a = '<a href=\"/tablets-subviews/subview-bus-' ~ stop ~ '?kiosk\">' -%}\n  {%- set cell = '<td>' ~ a ~ '<font color=\"#' ~ first[2] ~ '\"><b>' ~ first[1] ~ '</b></font></a></td>'\n    ~ '<td>' ~ a ~ '<font color=\"#' ~ line ~ '\">●</font> ' ~ station ~ '<small><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:walk\"></ha-icon>' ~ walk ~ ' min · ' ~ corner ~ '</small></a></td>'\n    ~ '<td>' ~ a ~ (times.t ~ ' <small>min</small>' if d.list else '<small>—</small>') ~ '</a></td>' -%}\n  {%- set ns.cells = ns.cells + [cell] -%}\n{%- endfor -%}\n<table>\n<tr><th colspan=\"3\"><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:bus\"></ha-icon> Buses to the metro</th><th colspan=\"3\" align=\"right\"><small><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:gesture-tap\"></ha-icon>tap a bus for its map{{ (' · as of ' ~ as_local(ns.asof).strftime('%H:%M')) if ns.asof else '' }}</small></th></tr>\n{%- for i in [0, 2, 4] %}\n<tr>{{ ns.cells[i] }}{{ ns.cells[i + 1] }}</tr>\n{%- endfor %}\n</table>",
